pomermaid [OPTIONS] [FILE]

  -t <arg>, --to <arg>
      The output format: pic, mp, svg, svg-ms (the groff document svg is made from), dump (the diagram read) or layout (its layout), the last two for tests.
  -o <arg>, --output <arg>
      Write to this file rather than standard output.
  --font <arg>
      Set labels in this groff font (TR by default).
  --size <arg>
      Set labels at this size, in points (10 by default).
  --width <arg>
      Make a diagram no wider than this, in inches, or with a unit, c or p (6i by default; 0 for no limit).
  --font-path <arg>
      Look for groff's fonts in these directories, separated by colons.
  --mp-macros <arg>
      For mp: copy pomermaid.mp's macros into the drawing (inline, the default) or input it (input).
  --svg-text <arg>
      For svg: keep labels as text (text, the default) or draw their glyphs as outlines (outline); pdftocairo always draws outlines.
  --svg-engine <arg>
      For svg: turn groff's PDF into SVG with mutool or pdftocairo (by default mutool if it is found, else pdftocairo).
  -v, --version
      Show pomermaid's version.
  -h, --help
      Show this help.
